}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000293",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "faiblesse de"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "weakness of"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Relates a vulnerability, vulnerability description or predisposing condition to the asset, organisation or process it is a weakness of. Shortcut for BFO 'inheres in', which cannot be used when the asset is software or information: in BFO-2020 a disposition can inhere only in a material bearer, so the weakness of a software asset strictly inheres in the copies or devices that carry it."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Relie une vulnérabilité ou une condition prédisposante à l'actif, à l'organisation ou au processus dont elle est une faiblesse. Raccourci de « inheres in » de BFO, inutilisable lorsque l'actif est un logiciel ou de l'information : dans BFO-2020, une disposition ne peut résider que dans un porteur matériel, de sorte que la faiblesse d'un actif logiciel réside au sens strict dans les copies ou les appareils qui le portent."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000064"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Found by HermiT on the CRG test fixture: 'vulnerability inheres in software asset' is inconsistent under BFO-2020."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "ISO/IEC 21838-2:2021 / BFO-2020, alignment target"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "MOACCO 1.2a (retired), Herzog et al. Security.owl concepts Threat, Vulnerability, Countermeasure"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2026-10-08"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291" : [ {
    "@value" : "0.1.0"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000294",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "description de source de menace"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "threat source description"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A description of a kind of threat source, such as a financially motivated cybercriminal, a negligent employee or a flood, with its type, used when the source is not an identified agent or process."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Description d'un type de source de menace, comme un cybercriminel motivé par l'appât du gain, un employé négligent ou une inondation, avec son type, utilisée lorsque la source n'est pas un agent ou un processus identifié."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284" : [ {
